<View class="body">
  <View class="B">1、"知时节"是做什么的？</View>
  <View class="C">
    "知时节"是知时节（南京）文化传媒有限公司的简称。
    "知时节"是一家女性公益创业的社会组织。联合家灏科技创作项目“Metaverse晟——与孔子跨千年的对话”获得2023紫金创投优秀资助项目。
  </View>
  <View class="B">2、"知时节"的经营理念是什么？</View>
  <view class="C">
    在"知时节"的女性社群经营过程中，将社会价值与经济价值创造性地融合，实现公益组织的"造血"功能，让更多女性拥有更多资源和能力从事社会公益服务。
  </view>
  <View class="B">3、"知时节"涉及哪些领域？</View>
  <view class="C">
    目前"知时节"以投资开发传统文化内容（皮影戏为主），重塑品牌（国产品牌为主），影视剧本创作、文化演出、民俗内容开发、新媒体元宇宙等多领域运营的传统文化创意内容。业务范围涵盖到文化产业的各个领域，秉承高品质文化创意传承的理念，以传递传承中国优秀传统文化品牌为目标，汇聚精英，已发展成为具有跨媒体、多元化的文化传媒公司。
  </view>
  <View class="B">4、"知时节"的社会价值是什么？</View>
  <view class="C">
    “知时节”致力于与传播和传承中华民族传统文化。在"知时节"的长期公益行为引领下，越来越多的人们逐渐意识到公益创业对社会和谐发展与推进社会治理能力提升的重要性，目前逐步实践创业孵化、亲子中英文学习分享、女性成长和力量等传播推广、家庭教育配套的生态系统初步形成。
  </view>
  <View class="B">5、“知时节”在文化传承中做了什么？</View>
  <view class="C">
    “知时节”每年参加多场公益演出，如江苏省高雅艺术进校园展演活动，南京公益演出项目，南京艺术基金资助项目，泰州惠民演出，南京惠民演出，苏州公共文化配送等。打造EMA中国原创的亲子阅读和中英文玩乐学习领军品牌，非遗皮影 “文遗小使者”，自然教育，急救逃生应急教育等。
  </view>
  <View class="B">1. "What is 'Zhishijie'?"</View>
  <view class="C">
    "Zhishijie" is the abbreviated name of Zhishijie (Nanjing) Cultural Media Co., Ltd. It is a social organization dedicated to female public welfare entrepreneurship. The collaborative project with Jiahao Technology "Metaverse Sheng: A Dialogue Across Millennia with Confucius" has been awarded the 2023 Zijin Investment Excellent Funding Project.
  </view>
  <View class="B">2. "What is Zhishijie’s business philosophy?"</View>
  <view class="C">
    In the process of operating female communities at Zhishijie, they creatively integrate social value with economic value to achieve the "hematopoietic" function of a public welfare organization. This aims to provide more resources and capabilities for women to engage in social welfare services.
  </view>
  <View class="B">3. "What areas does Zhishijie cover?"</View>
  <view class="C">
    Currently, Zhishijie operates in various fields within the cultural industry, focusing on investing in and developing traditional cultural content (mainly shadow puppetry), rebranding (mainly Chinese brands), scriptwriting for film and television, cultural performances, folklore content development, metaverse of new media, and other fields. It covers various sectors of the cultural industry, upholding the concept of inheriting high-quality cultural creativity, aiming to convey and inherit excellent traditional Chinese cultural brands. It has gathered elites and developed into a cross-media, diversified cultural media company.
  </view>
  <View class="B">4. "What is the social value of Zhishijie?"</View>
  <view class="C">
    "Zhishijie" is committed to the promotion and inheritance of traditional Chinese culture. Under the long-term guidance of Zhishijie’s public welfare actions, an increasing number of people have gradually realized the importance of public welfare entrepreneurship in promoting social harmony and enhancing the capacity for social governance. Currently, preliminary practices such as entrepreneurial incubation, parent-child Chinese-English learning and sharing, dissemination and promotion of female growth and empowerment, and the establishment of an ecosystem for family education support are underway.
  </view>
  <View class="B">5. What has "Zhishijie" done in cultural inheritance?</View>
  <view class="C">
    5."Zhishijie" has participated in many public welfare performances every year, such as the Elegant Art into School Performance Activity in Jiangsu Province, Nanjing Public Welfare Performance Project, Nanjing Art Fund Sponsored Project, Taizhou Benefiting the People Performance, Nanjing Benefiting the People Performance, Suzhou Public Cultural Delivery, and so on. It has also created EMA, China's original leading brand of parent-child reading and Chinese-English learning through play；"Cultural Heritage Little Envoy"；a non-heritage shadow puppetry；as well as natural education； emergency evacuation and first aid education, etc.
  </view>
